Welcome to EquinoxOS.

  This is the system shell (/bin/sh.elf), a thin wrapper around GNU bash
  with EquinoxOS branding, default environment, and crash containment.
  Coreutils are aliased to /bin/busybox.elf in /.bashrc.

  Tips:
    help            — bash builtins
    ls / ps         — file / process listing via busybox
    Ctrl-D / exit   — leave the shell

